  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おびれの　みずのリングで　なかまとあそぶのが　すき。　ちょうおんぱでいきものの　きもちを　さっちする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꼬리지느러미에 있는 물의 고리를 가지고 동료와 노는 것을 좋아한다. 초음파로 생명체의 기분을 감지한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜歡用尾鰭的水環和夥伴一起玩耍。能透過超音波察覺生物的心情。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il aime utiliser l’anneau d’eau de sa queue quand il joue avec ses congénères et se sert d’ultrasons pour comprendre les émotions des autres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit dem Wasserring an der Schwanzflosse spielt es gerne mit Artgenossen. Über Ultraschallwellen kann es die Gefühle anderer Lebewesen erfassen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le gusta jugar con sus congéneres con el anillo de agua de su aleta caudal. Utiliza ultrasonidos para percibir las emociones de otros seres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ama giocare assieme ai suoi simili con l’anello d’acqua che ha sulla coda. Utilizza gli ultrasuoni per percepire i sentimenti di altri esseri viventi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It likes playing with others of its kind using the water ring on its tail. It uses ultrasonic waves to sense the emotions of other living creatures.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尾びれの　水のリングで　仲間と遊ぶのが　好き。　超音波で生き物の　気持ちを　察知する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜欢用尾鳍的水环和伙伴一起玩耍。会通过超音波来感知生物的心情。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le gusta jugar con sus congéneres con el anillo de agua de su aleta caudal. Utiliza ultrasonidos para percibir las emociones de otros seres.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みずのリングは　あたまの　あなから　でる！\u0003\u0007粘着液ねんちゃくえき粘着液と　うみのみずを　まぜてつくりだしたものなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물의 고리는 머리의 구멍에서 나오는 점액질과 바닷물을 섞어서 만들어 낸 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠的水環是頭部的洞冒出來的黏膠與海水混合後製造出來的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a confectionné l’anneau autour de sa queue à partir d’eau de mer et du liquide collant que son évent sécrète.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Wasserring besteht aus einer Mischung aus Meerwasser und einer klebrigen Flüssigkeit, die aus dem Blasloch auf seinem Kopf austritt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su anillo de agua está compuesto por una mezcla de agua marina y de un líquido aglutinante que segrega por el espiráculo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Crea il suo anello mescolando acqua di mare al liquido viscoso che fuoriesce dal foro sulla testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its water ring is made from seawater mixed with a sticky fluid that Finizen secretes from its blowhole.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "水のリングは　頭の　穴から　出る！\u0003\u0007粘着液ねんちゃくえき粘着液と　海の水を　混ぜて作り出したものなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "水环是由从头部的洞冒出的黏胶与海水混合之后制作而成的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su anillo de agua está compuesto por una mezcla de agua marina y de un líquido aglutinante que segrega por el espiráculo.",
